{"overview":"می‌توانید تفاوت بین واقعیت و خیال را تشخیص دهید؟ در هر قسمت، داستان‌های عجیب، مرموز و شگفت‌انگیزی روایت می‌شود؛ تصمیم‌گیری برای بیننده است که کدام داستان‌ها واقعاً رخ داده‌اند و کدام‌ها کاملاً توسط نویسندگان ساخته شده‌اند. پاسخ توسط جاناتان فریکس در پایان هر قسمت فاش می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Can you tell the difference between fact and fiction? Several stories of strange, mysterious and incredible occurrences are chronicled during each episode. It is up to the viewer to decide which stories actually happened and which were completely fabricated by the show’s writers. The answer is revealed by Jonathan Frakes at the conclusion of each episode.","tagline_en":"","runtime":43,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":13,"y":2021,"poster":""},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":6,"y":1997,"poster":"/sG4ZeSlipzhWZ4THk9olIzjAmCs.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":13,"y":1998,"poster":"/dR58T2ZuKwvsRi0VTr4ML8uR0Iv.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":13,"y":2000,"poster":"/unFwDqfdHNqFI7IkJGEhm39I3iZ.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":13,"y":2002,"poster":"/dYV5BRcpllZ6V2vbdPvPIW30azK.jpg"}],"episodes":45,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Jonathan Frakes","role":"Self - Host","photo":"/b1C2FQzQPp4GsY0mGMxfvZCsKam.jpg"}],"trailer":"","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12323-beyond-belief-fact-or-fiction/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/gMZdpavHmxFNnLpMHwVxfqeux2g.png"},{"n":"fuboTV","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/3wF8xISfVlcrc8X3jaa3uMUFGAr.png"},{"n":"Peacock Premium","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/a1UIdq5BrkcAxnxcUhFsNbXnxeu.png"},{"n":"Amazon Prime Video with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/tpwTT1FpWqLLhxUfAuDavIXDDfI.png"},{"n":"Peacock Premium Plus","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/yrEwyMzEKdqAoGhaWUARtIxByol.png"},{"n":"The CW","kind":"free","logo":"/6fcYLKQIjGnrswtH7WxjjoSiyy3.png"},{"n":"Fawesome","kind":"free","logo":"/dNF4vWhF3TduWvOyfVxEyTqSNRl.png"},{"n":"The Roku Channe